    <section id="Sideload" class="how-it-works">
      <div class="container-7">
        <div class="hero-wrapper-screenshot">
          <div class="hero-split-3">
            <h1 class="heading-3">A New Way to Sideload</h1>
            <p class="body-text">
              AltStore is an app store designed for sideloading. Every app in
              AltStore gets a beautifully generated store page with detailed
              information to make sideloading fun and easy. Browse apps from
              trusted developers, or add additional &quot;sources&quot; to
              further increase your options.<br />
              <br />Plus, AltStore is made with security in mind. You can view a
              full list of an app&#x27;s permissions from its store page, and
              AltStore will even automatically alert you if they change so you
              can sideload with confidence.<br />
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://faq.altstore.io/"
              target="_blank"
              class="button-primary-4 w-button"
              >Learn More</a
            >
          </div>
          <img
            src="images/DeltaStorePage.PNG"
            srcset="
              images/DeltaStorePage-p-500.png   500w,
              images/DeltaStorePage-p-800.png   800w,
              images/DeltaStorePage-p-1080.png 1080w,
              images/DeltaStorePage.PNG        1339w
            "
            width="350"
            sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, 350px"
            alt=""
            class="shadow-two-3"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="hero-heading-center">
      <div class="container-7">
        <div class="hero-wrapper-screenshot">
          <img
            src="images/Monday-08-May-2023-162140.PNG"
            srcset="
              images/Monday-08-May-2023-162140-p-500.png   500w,
              images/Monday-08-May-2023-162140-p-800.png   800w,
              images/Monday-08-May-2023-162140-p-1080.png 1080w,
              images/Monday-08-May-2023-162140.PNG        1339w
            "
            width="350"
            sizes="(max-width: 479px) 90vw, 350px"
            alt=""
            class="shadow-two-3"
          />
          <div class="hero-split-3">
            <h1 class="heading-3">Self-Published Apps</h1>
            <p class="body-text">
              Anyone can distribute their apps with AltStore. All you need is to
              make a “source”, which you can do by hosting a text file with
              basic information about your apps. Users can then enter your
              source URL in AltStore and your apps will automatically appear.<br /><br />Follow
              our complete guide to create your own source and start
              distributing your apps in minutes!
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://faq.altstore.io/sources/make-a-source"
              target="_blank"
              class="button-primary-4 w-button"
              >Publish Apps</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
